# Personal Portfolio

This repository contains the source code for my personal developer portfolio.

The website showcases my work, technical skills and projects as a backend developer, mainly focused on Java and Spring Boot. It also reflects my learning journey into .NET and backend architecture.

The goal of this portfolio is to present my technical profile, highlight relevant projects and provide an easy way to explore my work and contact me.

## Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- GitHub Pages (deployment)

## Sections

- Hero (introduction)
- About me
- Tech stack
- Projects
- Contact

